Description: Provides an incremental Rcpp port of the 'ldgm' algorithms for
    linkage disequilibrium graphical models. The initial package exposes native
    graph primitives and documents the compatibility contract used while porting
    the bricking, brick-haplotype graph, reduction, SNP-list, and native
    tree-sequence file interfaces from the upstream Python and MATLAB
    implementation.
